<title>USA: Trump Hotels gets acquisition OK from N.J.</title>
<headline>Trump Hotels gets acquisition OK from N.J.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Jersey Casino Control Commission has unanimously approved the acquisition of the outstanding equity interests of Trump's Castle Associates by a unit of Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Resorts Inc, Trump Hotels said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trump's Castle Associates is owner and operator of Trump's Castle Casino Resort in Atlantic City.</p>
<p>A meeting of Trump Hotels shareholders to vote on the acquisition, by Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Resorts Holdings LP, is scheduled for September 30.</p>
</text>
